flowchart TD
    Start([User Input Prompt]) --> Memory[Load Conversation Memory & Context]
    Memory --> StateInit[Initialize Agent State]
    StateInit --> PlannerNode[Data Analyst Planner Node]
    PlannerNode --> PlanCheck{Plan Required?}
    
    PlanCheck -->|Yes| PromptBuilder[Construct Analysis Plan & Tool Calls]
    PlanCheck -->|No| DirectResponse[Generate Direct Answer]

    PromptBuilder --> LLMCall[Call LLM Provider]
    LLMCall --> ToolCheck{Tool Call Issued?}

    ToolCheck -->|DuckDB SQL| ToolDuckDB[packages/tools/duckdb_tools.py]
    ToolCheck -->|Chart Generation| ToolChart[packages/analysis/charts.py]
    ToolCheck -->|Data Profiling| ToolProfile[packages/tools/inspection.py]
    ToolCheck -->|Data Cleaning| ToolClean[packages/tools/cleaning.py]

    ToolDuckDB --> ExecutionResult[Process Dataset Result]
    ToolChart --> ExecutionResult
    ToolProfile --> ExecutionResult
    ToolClean --> ExecutionResult

    ExecutionResult --> StateUpdate[Update Agent State & Scratchpad]
    StateUpdate --> LLMCall

    ToolCheck -->|No / Completed| Synthesizer[Synthesize Final Response & Artifacts]
    Synthesizer --> SSEStream[Stream SSE Tokens to Client]
    DirectResponse --> SSEStream
    SSEStream --> End([End Conversation Turn])
